Package: superv
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-glib-2.0
Recommends: fonts-noto-color-emoji, libxtst6
Provides: superdot
Conflicts: superdot
Replaces: superdot
Description: Clipboard and emoji for Linux: Win+V and Win+. panels
 SuperV brings two Windows panels to Linux. Super+V shows the last 25
 things you copied (text and images): pick one to paste it into the app
 you are using, pin favourites, clear the rest. Super+. opens the emoji
 panel: type to search emoji, kaomoji and symbols, and the one you pick is
 typed where you were writing. Works on GNOME, KDE Plasma, Cinnamon, MATE
 and Xfce, on Wayland and X11. Never connects to the internet.
 .
 Replaces SuperDot, which is now part of SuperV.
